# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the tp4/packed-prefix development window (sticky sessions on the eight-seat 262k packed path;
# scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/packed-prefix and push a tag
# experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a registry: the cards are resolved at run time. The jobs are templates only: no tag is
# pushed from this branch by its author.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-packed-prefix-1 is what B0 builds from the pushed tp4/packed-prefix commit; every later job serves that one image. A commit of a
# file the image carries needs a new B0 build and a new tag in every template. The cards are under development: this window never stops, starts or hands back the node agent.
# R0: the agent-turn replay: EIGHT coding agents (every seat) of eight turns each, growing contexts (first contexts 8k-40k tokens, about 2k-token tool results, exponential think gaps), 192-token answers, audits OFF. Both arms in ONE job (agent-turns-prefix on c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-prefix-time-gate, then agent-turns-baseline on the control c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-best-time-gate; each arm
# its own container after the other is removed). The plan compares the two transcripts turn by turn: EXACTNESS vs COLD END TO END (the conversation feeds the model's own answers back, so one divergence
# changes every later prompt of its conversation: it is reported at its first turn). READ: the '[TURN]' lines (per turn: prompt tokens, tokens REUSED, tokens NEW, TTFT, decode tok/s, engine build), the
# prefix arm NOT_EXERCISED only when an agent that continued never reused a token, the transcript line 'N turns paired, N identical, 0 diverged', the continuation TTFT with reuse against without.
# This job pairs unpaired in time (prefix first, control second): the PAIRED reading is R1-R4. Duration (estimate): 120 min. Soft.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset prefix
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-packed-prefix-1
C2_PREFIX_PLAN=agent-turns
C2_PREFIX_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-prefix-time-gate
C2_PREFIX_BASELINE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-best-time-gate
C2_PREFIX_AGENTS=8
